      "message": "I think old logic mistakenly treated \u003e\u003d3.67V as valid VBUS, causing wrong state transitions. New logic accurate detection of VBUS_SAFE0V, VBUS_PRESENT, VBUS_REMOVED will allow the device to correctly stay in Attachwait.SRC for 500ms (step-16) and wait for VBUS_SAFE0V before sourcing VBUS(step-18)",
